# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# JSpec runtime state (derived - rebuildable from the repo, never the source of truth)
.jspec/index.db
.jspec/*.sqlite*
.jspec/cache/

# Runtime ledgers are LOCAL by default. Commit them deliberately if you want the
# audit trail in git - do not let them arrive by accident.
.jspec/traces.jsonl
.jspec/gates.jsonl

# Chat history / session journal - LOCAL ONLY, by the owner's instruction (D-029).
# Keep writing it every session (CLAUDE.md 0b) - it is how a new chat resumes. It is
# just not version-controlled: it is working memory, not a project artifact.
# NOTE: git is therefore not its backup. This folder syncs to OneDrive; that is.
# Never `git add -f` these. Decisions worth keeping go to DECISIONS.md, which IS committed.
memory/journal/

# Secrets - never commit. JSpec needs no API key; if one appears here, something is wrong.
.env
*.pem
*.key

# OS / editor
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
